<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009364400" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009364660"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000093648C0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009364B20" style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009364D80" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009364FE0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009365240"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000093654A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009365700" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009365960"><tr width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009365BC0"><td align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009365E20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009366080" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div><div data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009366410" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px; width: 680px;">Your Agency's access to Qantas Wholesale fares</div><div data_liveedit_tagid="00000000093667A0" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009367470" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000093676D0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009367930"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009367B90" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009367DF0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/qantas-header-banner.jpg" title="Qantas" style="width: 680px;"></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009368D10" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009368F70"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009369360"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009369800" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009369B90"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009369DF0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936A050"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936A2B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936AAE0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936AD40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Dear Agency Partner,</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936B200"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936C8A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936D390"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936D5F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">We're pleased to provide your Agency access to Qantas international Wholesale fares.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000091861D0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001FF13A60">Wholesale fares have one price point, and are sold as a package with another product, such as hotels, cruise packages or tours. Our international Wholesale fares currently provide multiple market access (not only the markets you service), which may be subject to change.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936D980"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936DA90">Please find attached our&nbsp;<em data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936E000">Qantas Wholesale Fare clue card</em>, where you will find information about our Wholesale fare product.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936DBA0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936E390">If you have any questions or require further information, please let us know.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936E5D0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936E6E0">Kind regards,<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936E920">Agency Partnerships and Leisure Sales<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936EB60"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936EC70"><em data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936EEB0">Qantas Airways Limited</em></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936F4A0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936F700" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936FBC0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000936FE20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009371210"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009371470" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009371890" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009371AF0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009371D50"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009371FB0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009372210" style="font-size: 10px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009372470"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000093726D0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009372930" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009372DF0"><td align="center" valign="top" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001FF05EF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001FF06280" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001FF07680"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001FF08B90"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001FF08DF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td><td align="right" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001FF0BB60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: right; width: 167px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001FF0C9A0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/QF-oneworld-logo-lockup.png" title="Qantas" width="166" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001FF09BC0"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_live